# API Configuration
#
# Local development against a backend on your machine:
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000/api

# Production is set in .env.production (committed), which Vite loads
# automatically during `npm run build`:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://upgrbihy03.execute-api.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/api
#
# NOTE: Vite inlines VITE_* at build time. Changing this in a hosting
# dashboard has no effect until the site is rebuilt.

# Google Analytics measurement ID (e.g. G-XXXXXXXXXX).
#
# Optional and unset by default: with no value the site loads no analytics
# script and sets no cookies, so a build without it carries no NDPR consent
# obligation. Events are still pushed to window.dataLayer, so Tag Manager or
# another tool can be attached later without touching any call site.
VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=
